{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51766","headline":"咏後主出降（《後山诗话》以爲花蕊夫人作，但前二句多异文） · 王承旨","name":"咏後主出降（《後山诗话》以爲花蕊夫人作，但前二句多异文）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜀朝昬主出降时，衔璧牵羊倒系旗。\n二十万军齐拱手，更无一个是男儿。\n（《监诫录》五《徐后事》）（〖1〗王承旨，应即王仁裕，详《全唐诗续拾》卷四二。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王承旨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51766.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51766","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}